          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While there are two or more enemy units within 12” of this unit, this unit gains the following ability:

Without Peer: For each wound this unit’s GREY KNIGHT PALADIN model is selected to suffer, roll a D6. On a 5+, the Saving Throw for that wound succeeds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lay on Hands" id="7b8a-e775-2e17-7bd4" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s Move step, if there is a GREY KNIGHT PALADIN model in this unit, select up to one other friendly infantry or monster unit within 4&quot; of this unit. The selected unit Heals 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
