          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s Move step, you may select up to one friendly vehicle unit within 4&quot;. If you do, the selected unit Repairs X, where X is the highest dice result of this unit&apos;s last Psychic Test. Then, skip the Attacks step this turn and if this was your first turn in a row, after the End step, take another turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
